    "style": "Warm, softly lit cartoon, retaining wood/slate palette and player-facing blank recipe-board identity.",
    "modelingPolicy": "Reward useful native form, proportion, construction and purposeful decoration improvements. Do not require original part counts or weak geometry; do not require a literal imagegen repaint.",
    "aestheticOutcomes": [
      {
        "id": "crafted-volume",
        "observable": "At logical game scale the board has rounded, substantial rails and clearly organized supports/joints. Added detail communicates craft or structure. Silhouette and material changes improve identity/readability within the locked envelope."
      },
      {
        "id": "warm-palette",
        "observable": "Frame reads warm honey/orange wood, distinct from a quiet dark blue-slate writing surface. Warm lower supports remain readable rather than collapsing into black or muddy brown."
      },
      {
        "id": "soft-coherent-light",
        "observable": "Soft highlights follow native edge volumes coherently across rails, caps and supports; transitions retain midtone volume with no blown white/yellow slabs, black dead spots, arbitrary face-tone discontinuities or baked horizontal light bias."
      },
      {
        "id": "material-detail",
        "observable": "Wood and slate feel intentionally different with restrained native material character and useful crafted accents. Detail remains stable in motion and does not become stripes/noise or imitate imagegen halos."
      },
      {
        "id": "usable-display",
        "observable": "Writing area stays empty, visibly blue-slate and readable, with useful interior space around the exact recipe/display socket. No text, recipe icons, bolts or other decoration encroach on the dynamic content clearance."
      },
      {
        "id": "artifact-free-motion",
        "observable": "Idle and all selected/recipe-change frames keep distinct readable rail/support volumes with no coplanar flicker, accidental dark overlaps, clipping, detached trim, broken corners, halos, opaque matte, unwanted cast shadow or texture swimming. Selected playback closes naturally; nonloop recipe-change remains coherent."
      }
    ],
